# Story: As a truck driver, I want to book a gate slot for my container, so that I can drop it off at a set time without queueing. A slot has a fixed number of places; booking takes one place and gives me a booking reference. When no places are left the booking is refused with SLOT_FULL.

@draft

Feature: Booking a Gate Slot

Scenario Outline: Book a gate slot for a valid container
  Given I am a driver
  And there are <places> places available in the gate
  When I book that slot for a valid container "<container>"
  Then the booking is confirmed with a reference
  And the slot has <remaining_places> place(s) left

Examples:
| places | remaining_places |
| 2      | 1                |
| 3      | 0                |

Scenario: Slot Full Error Case
  Given I am a driver
  When I book that slot for a valid container "<container>"
  Then the booking is refused because "SLOT_FULL"

Scenario Outline: Duplicate Booking
  Given another driver has booked that slot for the same container
  And my booking is still active
  When they check in their slot
  Then their booking is refused because "DUPLICATE_ACTIVE_BOOKING"

Scenario: Canceling a Booking
  Given I have booked that slot for a valid container
  When I cancel my booking
  Then my booking is "CANCELLED"
  And the slot has <remaining_places> place(s) left

Scenario: Change Cutoff Passed Error Case
  Given another driver has booked that slot
  When I try to change it because "CHANGE_CUTOFF_PASSED"
  Then the change is refused because "CHANGE_CUTOFF_PASSED"

Scenario: Check-in Too Early Error Case
  Given a gate slot with room for 1 truck
  And my booking is still active
  When I check in myself at <checkin_time>
  Then the check-in is refused because "CHECKIN_TOO_EARLY"

Scenario: Checked In by Clerk
  Given another driver has booked that slot
  When a clerk checks it in on the gate screen
  Then the gate screen shows the booking as checked in

Scenario: Slot Confirmed at Specific Time
  Given a gate slot with room for 1 truck
  And my booking is still active
  When I check in myself at <checkin_time>
  Then the check-in is refused because "FORBIDDEN"

Scenario: Booking Screen Shows Checked In
  Given another driver has booked that slot on the booking screen
  When a clerk checks it in on the gate screen
  Then the gate screen shows the booking as checked in
